Two things stand out. First, the prices cluster: $10 to $20 for a single paid seat, $100 to $200 at the top. Second, the cheapest sticker prices hide different meanings of "usage." Cursor Plus at $8 only runs Cursor's own models, Zed Pro's $10 includes $5 of tokens, and Trae and Kiro both express usage in a unit you can run out of. Compare what the entry plan includes, not just the number.

