Notes on the "Partial" cells:

- **Claude Code**: the docs list the terminal, IDE extensions, a desktop app and the browser. There is no editor of its own beyond those surfaces.
- **GitHub Copilot, Codex, Kilo Code, Junie**: these run as extensions or inside an IDE you already have, plus (for Codex) a desktop app.
